	<groupId>org.eva</groupId>
	<artifactId>vtiger_automation_framework_v2</artifactId>
	<version>0.0.1-SNAPSHOT</version>


	<!-- 1.There are three important dependencies will have to add
			   But all dependencies should be related to "io.cucumber" and same version not different
			   Which is given as below the line
		     a.Cucumber JVM: Java :- cucumber-java
		     b Cucumber JVM: JUnit 4:- cucumber-core
			 c.Cucumber JVM: Core :- cucumber-junit
			 
			 2.Once the dependencies(jars) are downloaded inside the .m2(dot m2)[local repository] folders
			   then if you again require same jars to set or download again then it doesn't download again
			 3.Local Repository-Where it downloads as inside the local disk(.m2 folder)
			                   - Address of local repository is .m2 folder
			                   -whenever our .m2 is currupted then to resolve this problem 
			                    simply we delete it and go to pom.xml and open and sava it then automatically
			                    it creates a new fress .m2(local repository)
			 4.Central repository- where all the repositories is downloaded from mvnrepository site
			 5.Whenver we upadate maven project then sometimes we get error and we don't use
			   driver.findElement(By.xpath("")).sendKeys(""); because it takes byDefault java
			   compiler 1.5 version so to overcome this problem we set to above version of java
			   compiler 1.6,1.7,1.8,1.9,1.10 ,11,12,13....till now version
			   but when again update our maven project then again we face this type of problem 
			   so to overcome this problem forever then we use this concept i.e given as below the line
			   we can google -maven java compiler version to Setting the 
			   source and -target of the Java Compiler...
			 6.groupId:-groupid in Maven represents the id of the project group.
			   for example-
			              - org.eva
			              - com.evs
			 7.artiFactId - artifactid represents the id of the project.
			  for example-
			              - vtiger
			              - vtigercrm5
			8. src/main/java :-Contains the Java source code for the project
			                   -for example : page wise classes and util class
			 9. src/main/resources :-Contains resources that are used by the Java code.
			                        -for example : the Java code, such as configuration files, images, 
			                         and other static content.
			 10.src/test/java :-Contains the Java source code for the unit tests for the project
			 			       -for example : testscript and runner

			 11.src/test/resources :- Contains resources that are used by the unit tests
			                        -for example : feature file
			 12.selenium repository is downloaded in this path
			    C:\Users\hp\.m2\repository\org\seleniumhq\selenium\selenium-chromium-driver
			    
					 -->
	<properties>
		<maven.compiler.source>18</maven.compiler.source>
		<maven.compiler.target>18</maven.compiler.target>
	</properties>
	
	<dependencies>

